msgstr "%d 项内容更新未能投递并已丢弃，请先开启“站点知识库”，再点击“更新知识库”重新发送。"

#: includes/class-cloud-settings-actions.php:518
msgid "Connection and account checks passed. AI generation was not tested."
msgstr "连接与账号访问检查通过，尚未测试 AI 生成。"

#: includes/class-cloud-settings-page.php:1313
msgid "Connection checks do not generate AI content or resolve failed editor requests."
msgstr "连接检查不会执行 AI 生成，也不会修复编辑器中已失败的请求。"

#: includes/class-cloud-settings-page.php:1507
msgid "Check connection and account access"
msgstr "检查连接与账号访问"

#: includes/class-cloud-wordpress-ai-connector.php:845
msgid "This AI input exceeds the size limit, including formatting and instructions. Retry with shorter input or process it in smaller sections; you do not need to delete the original article."
msgstr "本次 AI 输入超过大小限制（含格式和提示词）。请使用精简内容或分段处理后重试，无需删除原文。"

#: includes/class-cloud-wordpress-ai-connector.php:846
msgid "This text input exceeds 50,000 characters, including formatting. Retry with shorter input or select a smaller section; you do not need to delete the original article."
msgstr "本次文字输入超过 50,000 个字符（含格式标记）。请使用精简内容或选取较小段落后重试，无需删除原文。"

#: includes/class-cloud-wordpress-ai-connector.php:848
msgid "The selected model cannot fit this input and the requested output. Use shorter input or choose a model with a larger context window in Npcink Cloud > AI resources, then try again."
msgstr "当前模型无法容纳本次输入和所需输出。请精简输入，或前往 Npcink Cloud > AI 资源选择上下文容量更大的模型后重试。"

#: includes/class-cloud-wordpress-ai-connector.php:849
msgid "The AI instructions exceed 12,000 characters. Shorten the custom instructions for this feature, then try again."
msgstr "AI 提示词超过 12,000 个字符。请精简此功能的自定义提示词后重试。"

#: includes/class-cloud-wordpress-ai-connector.php:847
msgid "The AI result is incomplete or exceeds the output limit. The original article is unchanged. Select a smaller section or choose a model with enough output capacity, then try again."
msgstr "AI 结果未完成或超过输出上限，原文章未被修改。请选择较小段落，或选择输出容量足够的模型后重试。"

#: includes/class-cloud-runtime-request-guards.php:220
msgid "Choose Shorten, Expand, or Rephrase in the content editor, then try again."
msgstr "请在内容编辑器中选择“缩短”“扩写”或“改写”，然后重试。"

#: includes/class-cloud-wordpress-ai-approval.php:50
msgid "Npcink Cloud is pending connector approval. Ask a site administrator to approve it under Tools > Connector Approvals."
msgstr "Npcink Cloud 连接器待审批。请站点管理员前往「工具 → 连接器审批」批准使用。"

#: includes/class-cloud-runtime-request-guards.php:562
msgid "WordPress AI image editing accepts only an Artifact id and bounded prompt."
msgstr "WordPress AI 图片编辑仅接受 Artifact ID 和有长度限制的提示词。"

#: includes/class-cloud-runtime-request-guards.php:570
msgid "WordPress AI image editing requires a valid source_artifact_id."
msgstr "WordPress AI 图片编辑需要有效的 source_artifact_id。"

#: includes/class-cloud-runtime-request-guards.php:578
msgid "WordPress AI image editing prompt must be a nonempty string of at most 4000 characters."
msgstr "WordPress AI 图片编辑提示词不能为空，且最多为 4000 个字符。"

#: includes/class-cloud-wordpress-ai-text-model.php:373
msgid "The title result is not available yet. Wait a moment, then try again with the same draft to check the original request."
msgstr "暂未收到标题结果。请稍候，在同一草稿中保持内容不变，再点一次生成以查看原请求的结果。"

#: includes/class-cloud-wordpress-ai-text-model.php:356
msgid "The earlier title result is no longer available. Generate a new title to continue."
msgstr "上一次的标题结果已无法取回，请重新生成标题。"

#: includes/class-cloud-settings-page.php:1926
msgid "Retry reading usage"
msgstr "重试读取用量"

#: includes/class-cloud-settings-page.php:1927
msgid "Usage read details"
msgstr "用量读取详情"
